  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v2.0.0-rc.1 - RELEASE CANDIDATE - Please test before production use\n\n\t\t\t⚠️ BREAKING CHANGES - This is a pre-release version with major changes from v1.x\n\n\t\t\tMajor Changes:\n\t\t\t- Modernized API surface with PascalCase property names\n\t\t\t- Enabled nullable reference types throughout\n\t\t\t- Added strongly-typed enum parameters (no more magic numbers)\n\t\t\t- Implemented Alert Contacts, Maintenance Windows, and Status Pages APIs\n\t\t\t- Added automatic pagination support with IAsyncEnumerable\n\t\t\t- Added cancellation token support to all async methods\n\t\t\t- Improved exception handling with custom exception types\n\t\t\t- Added .NET 9.0 support\n\t\t\t- Added comprehensive XML documentation\n\t\t\t- Performance optimizations\n\n\t\t\tMigration Guide: See CHANGELOG.md for detailed migration instructions\n\n\t\t\tPlease report any issues on GitHub before the final 2.0.0 release.",
